From d3fb28840fc2732efb798fb4d03858514bbd63ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Minkovsky <dminkovsky@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 10:44:34 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Read a verdict's and a run's cards from the rows that stored
 them

The pane and the run in flight select the cards in one statement over the
layout the write stored: the cards ranked by their best offered row, each
row's badges and notes, the count of rows set aside and whether the offered
rows are pressings of one album. The in-memory fold, the resumed identify
state and the pane's audio facts read are gone; the rules that remain
(judging and grouping) run only in the write, and tests hold the statement
to them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
